    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/28b8dadf34f37e8486bf712ee4da6b7c.avif?t=1751305233\" width=618 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While on his daily hike, Biggie discovers a glowing door on the side of a mountain he's never seen before! What awaits him inside?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/713b80a0c24c2b1b1f4db4f0045271d9.poster.avif?t=1751305233\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/713b80a0c24c2b1b1f4db4f0045271d9.webm?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/713b80a0c24c2b1b1f4db4f0045271d9.mp4?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A CUB-SIZED ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/ec89785eba3bb367fbf1ccf7a4575524.avif?t=1751305233\" width=618 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 11 explorable rooms packed with their own characters and collectibles. Inspect every corner and you might be surprised at what you discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/e6dda6957a46b0a21638d837eae11355.poster.avif?t=1751305233\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/e6dda6957a46b0a21638d837eae11355.webm?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/e6dda6957a46b0a21638d837eae11355.mp4?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESTORE THE LIBRARY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/335d3039598864e5407a24403a8c48d9.avif?t=1751305233\" width=618 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The library has been dormant for years.. Collect all of the crystal pieces and bring it back to it's former glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/c0dbcf61a880c0027c6dd7bda23fcdf4.poster.avif?t=1751305233\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/c0dbcf61a880c0027c6dd7bda23fcdf4.webm?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/c0dbcf61a880c0027c6dd7bda23fcdf4.mp4?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAGIC ABOUNDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/1790bd66785b4d0b9c70105ca0dfdb7a.avif?t=1751305233\" width=300 height=154 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/c946aa7379db1b1c48ff8554156eb497.avif?t=1751305233\" width=309 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biggie was blessed with the natural ability to perform spells. Find spell books throughout the library that grant him traversal and puzzle solving abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/ba18481bc8e47d620380dba6c2ef6b83.poster.avif?t=1751305233\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/ba18481bc8e47d620380dba6c2ef6b83.webm?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/ba18481bc8e47d620380dba6c2ef6b83.mp4?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...AND MORE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your snout to the ground as the game finishes development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/aef4be28e782fc7b6114448082d97545.avif?t=1751305233\" width=618 height=416 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/28b8dadf34f37e8486bf712ee4da6b7c.avif?t=1751305233\" width=618 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While on his daily hike, Biggie discovers a glowing door on the side of a mountain he's never seen before! What awaits him inside?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/713b80a0c24c2b1b1f4db4f0045271d9.poster.avif?t=1751305233\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/713b80a0c24c2b1b1f4db4f0045271d9.webm?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/713b80a0c24c2b1b1f4db4f0045271d9.mp4?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A CUB-SIZED ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/ec89785eba3bb367fbf1ccf7a4575524.avif?t=1751305233\" width=618 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 11 explorable rooms packed with their own characters and collectibles. Inspect every corner and you might be surprised at what you discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/e6dda6957a46b0a21638d837eae11355.poster.avif?t=1751305233\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/e6dda6957a46b0a21638d837eae11355.webm?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/e6dda6957a46b0a21638d837eae11355.mp4?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESTORE THE LIBRARY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/335d3039598864e5407a24403a8c48d9.avif?t=1751305233\" width=618 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The library has been dormant for years.. Collect all of the crystal pieces and bring it back to it's former glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/c0dbcf61a880c0027c6dd7bda23fcdf4.poster.avif?t=1751305233\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/c0dbcf61a880c0027c6dd7bda23fcdf4.webm?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/c0dbcf61a880c0027c6dd7bda23fcdf4.mp4?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAGIC ABOUNDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/1790bd66785b4d0b9c70105ca0dfdb7a.avif?t=1751305233\" width=300 height=154 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/c946aa7379db1b1c48ff8554156eb497.avif?t=1751305233\" width=309 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biggie was blessed with the natural ability to perform spells. Find spell books throughout the library that grant him traversal and puzzle solving abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/ba18481bc8e47d620380dba6c2ef6b83.poster.avif?t=1751305233\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/ba18481bc8e47d620380dba6c2ef6b83.webm?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/ba18481bc8e47d620380dba6c2ef6b83.mp4?t=1751305233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...AND MORE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your snout to the ground as the game finishes development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638310/extras/aef4be28e782fc7b6114448082d97545.avif?t=1751305233\" width=618 height=416 /></span></p>",
